{"name":"The Obelisco","size":"huge","type":"beast","tag":"","alignment":"lawful evil","hitDice":"9","armorName":"natural armor","shieldBonus":0,"natArmorBonus":8,"otherArmorDesc":"19 (natural armor)","speed":"40","burrowSpeed":"30","climbSpeed":"0","flySpeed":"80","hover":false,"swimSpeed":"0","customHP":false,"customSpeed":true,"hpText":"225 (18d12 + 108)","speedDesc":"12m, burrow 9m, fly 24m","strPoints":"25","dexPoints":"10","conPoints":"23","intPoints":"16","wisPoints":"15","chaPoints":"19","blindsight":"60","blind":false,"darkvision":"120","tremorsense":"0","truesight":"0","telepathy":0,"cr":"16","customCr":"16 (15,000 XP)","customProf":5,"isLegendary":false,"legendariesDescription":"The dragon can take 3 legendary actions, choosing from the options below. Only one legendary action option can be used at a time and only at the end of another creature's turn. The dragon regains spent legendary actions at the start of its turn.","isLair":false,"lairDescription":"When fighting inside its lair, the adult blue dragon can invoke the ambient magic to take lair actions. On initiative count 20 (losing initiative ties), the adult blue dragon can take one lair action to cause one of the following effects:","lairDescriptionEnd":"The adult blue dragon can't repeat an effect until they have all been used, and it can't use the same effect two rounds in a row.","isMythic":false,"mythicDescription":"If the adult blue dragon's mythic trait is active, it can use the options below as legendary actions for 1 hour after using {Some Ability}.","isRegional":false,"regionalDescription":"The region containing the adult blue dragon's lair is warped by the creature's presence, which creates one or more of the following effects:","regionalDescriptionEnd":"If the adult blue dragon dies, the first two effects fade over the course of 3d10 days.","properties":[],"abilities":[{"name":"Legendary Resistance (1/Day)","desc":"If the dragon fails a saving throw, it can choose to succeed instead."}],